# Frozen benchmark fixtures are hashed byte-for-byte: prompt, spec and grading
# sha256 values live in test/benchmarks/plans/*.json and must not drift across
# platforms. A Windows checkout that rewrites LF to CRLF changes those bytes, so
# keep this tree LF everywhere. The rule is intentionally scoped to
# test/benchmarks and does not change line-ending handling for the rest of the
# repository.
test/benchmarks/** text eol=lf
